{
	"$comment": "pipelinq's admin settings in the Zuiddrecht set, general and POS tabs, as PqBeheer and PqBeheerKassa draw them: the simple menu with Verkoop, Kassa and Producten switched on; agent profiles for pieter, Fatma Yildiz and joris on the skills of 41-appointments.json; the payment providers (CCV live, Mollie in test, Adyen and Stripe off); the tender types with their ledger accounts; the POS roles and who holds them. The CCV key itself is not in the set: config names the credential it comes from. Lead sources and request channels are Nextcloud system tags, which a set cannot write, and VAT 21/9/0/0 is pipelinq's default, so neither is here.",
	"appConfig": [
		{
			"key": "menu_modules",
			"value": "sales,pos,products"
		}
	],
